'''Crystal Falls''' is a waterfall in [[Northwind]] that feeds into both [[Grimmen Lake]] to the north, and into the [[Northshire River]] to the south, eventually emptying out in [[Crystal Lake]] in [[Elwynn Forest]]. The falls have been overrun with members of the [[Defias Brotherhood]] led by [[Edward Paddley]], who was sent on orders from [[Edwin VanCleef]] to plunder the nobles of Northwind.<ref>[[VanCleef's Orders]]</ref>

